@HostAddress = http://localhost:5086
@ProductionUrl = https://prueba-tecnica-ahee.onrender.com

### 1. Health Check (Local)
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### 2. Health Check (Production)
GET {{ProductionUrl}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### 3. Listar Productos Paginados (Local)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 4. Listar Productos Paginados (Producción)
GET {{ProductionUrl}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 5. Crear Nuevo Producto
# @name createProduct
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Microcrédito Mujer Digital",
  "description": "Línea de crédito para adquisición de tecnología y comercio digital.",
  "price": 1450000.00,
  "initialStock": 25
}

### 6. Consultar Producto por ID
@CreatedId = {{createProduct.response.body.id}}
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/{{CreatedId}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Ajustar Stock (+10 unidades)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/products/{{CreatedId}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityDelta": 10
}

### 8. Descontar Stock (-20 unidades)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/products/{{CreatedId}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityDelta": -20
}

### 9. Intento de Descuento Inválido (Stock Negativo -> 400 Bad Request ProblemDetails)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/products/{{CreatedId}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityDelta": -500
}

### 10. Actualizar Información General del Producto
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/products/{{CreatedId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Microcrédito Mujer Digital Plus",
  "description": "Línea ampliada con asesoría empresarial y comercio digital.",
  "price": 1600000.00
}

### 11. Eliminar Producto (Desactivación Lógica -> 204 No Content)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/products/{{CreatedId}}
